  "name": "google-breakpad-sys",
  "description": "Low-level Rust FFI bindings and integrated build system for Google Breakpad, a comprehensive multi-platform crash-reporting system. The project facilitates the generation of minidumps from crashed processes and provides tools for stackwalking and symbol resolution using DWARF, ELF, and Mach-O debug formats.",
